  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_174605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 359px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"12\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"13\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"15\">Aquest dissabte, 10 d&#39;octubre, ha comen&ccedil;at el FES Tales, que</span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"14\"> tornar&agrave; en una nova sessi&oacute; diumenge 8 de novembre. Organitzat pel Centre Cultural Tales i patrocinat per l&#39;Ajuntament, la Diputaci&oacute; de Castell&oacute; i la Generalitat, est&agrave; dirigit novament per Pepa Cases.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_172335.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"9\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"10\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"11\">Guillermo Le&oacute;n, de M&egrave;xic, amb la pe&ccedil;a de circ &#39;&iquest;Qu&eacute; sombrero est&aacute; pasando?&#39; ha trencat el foc. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_182017.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"6\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"7\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"8\">Despr&eacute;s ha sigut el torn del duet Depaso i el circ aeri &#39;La Trottola&#39;. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/IMG_20201010_191959.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"5\">La clown Maria Andr&eacute;s ha presentat la pe&ccedil;a &#39;Fr&agrave;gil&#39;. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/10/JujaFesTales-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"2\">Per a finalitzar ha hagut esquetxos amb els valencianets Juja.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n"
